### Part 5: Real-Time Mini Programs

* Student Management: Use a static method to display college name and an instance method to display student details.

* Bank Account: Use a static method to display bank name and an instance method to display account balance.

* Employee Management: Use a static method to display company name and an instance method to display employee salary.

* Calculator: Use static methods for addition and subtraction, and instance methods for multiplication and division.

